{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "wc46xaahm7s9159b", "title": "96.Transformers多模态流水线任务", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><p data-lake-id=\"ub1a3d314\" id=\"ub1a3d314\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf4500da3\" id=\"uf4500da3\">示例代码</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0b0c1578\" id=\"u0b0c1578\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"file\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fattachments%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fppt%2F2424104%2F1745804257855-635607a0-9b87-4582-8400-816067d3f89f.ppt%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22multimodal-task.ppt%22%2C%22size%22%3A378436%2C%22ext%22%3A%22ppt%22%2C%22source%22%3A%22%22%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22download%22%3Atrue%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22udaf69980-95fa-434f-aa9f-0bfd44a583d%22%2C%22taskType%22%3A%22upload%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22application%2Fvnd.ms-powerpoint%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uc004a0d4%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2a34d5f0\" id=\"u2a34d5f0\"><em><span data-lake-id=\"u9eed3d13\" id=\"u9eed3d13\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #DF2A3F\">注：将ppt后缀名改为zip后解压</span></em></p><p data-lake-id=\"u108e4921\" id=\"u108e4921\"><br></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"EdHTY\" id=\"EdHTY\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9d8a8570\" id=\"u9d8a8570\">推理pipeline</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u7db98980\" id=\"u7db98980\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue0168e7e\" id=\"ue0168e7e\">[</span><code data-lake-id=\"uaff8073a\" id=\"uaff8073a\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf0ea0190\" id=\"uf0ea0190\">pipeline</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uc0a6dca2\" id=\"uc0a6dca2\">] 让使用</span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/models\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ude32fdef\" id=\"ude32fdef\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf8435370\" id=\"uf8435370\">Hub</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u8042ee97\" id=\"u8042ee97\">上的任何模型进行任何语言、计算机视觉、语音以及多模态任务的推理变得非常简单。即使您对特定的模态没有经验，或者不熟悉模型的源码，您仍然可以使用[</span><code data-lake-id=\"u40390b43\" id=\"u40390b43\"><span data-lake-id=\"u009abe62\" id=\"u009abe62\">pipeline</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u1a770f90\" id=\"u1a770f90\">]进行推理！本教程将教您：</span></p><ul list=\"u907161be\"><li fid=\"u21f7f728\" data-lake-id=\"uf9023049\" id=\"uf9023049\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4da87c3a\" id=\"u4da87c3a\">如何使用[</span><code data-lake-id=\"u4d9079f2\" id=\"u4d9079f2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc1c623de\" id=\"uc1c623de\">pipeline</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u231c07f9\" id=\"u231c07f9\">] 进行推理。</span></li><li fid=\"u21f7f728\" data-lake-id=\"u064d13d1\" id=\"u064d13d1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1e2d117a\" id=\"u1e2d117a\">如何使用特定的</span><code data-lake-id=\"u8f1a2b45\" id=\"u8f1a2b45\"><span data-lake-id=\"u06cea72e\" id=\"u06cea72e\">tokenizer</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ud9bbfe92\" id=\"ud9bbfe92\">(分词器)或模型。</span></li><li fid=\"u21f7f728\" data-lake-id=\"ua9fa94a0\" id=\"ua9fa94a0\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub1147c45\" id=\"ub1147c45\">如何使用[</span><code data-lake-id=\"uaf2067c1\" id=\"uaf2067c1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u31aec273\" id=\"u31aec273\">pipeline</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue35d1941\" id=\"ue35d1941\">] 进行音频、视觉和多模态任务的推理。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u5d903ae2\" id=\"u5d903ae2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud668185b\" id=\"ud668185b\"> 请查看[</span><code data-lake-id=\"u9820cd1e\" id=\"u9820cd1e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud1e66c14\" id=\"ud1e66c14\">pipeline</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u8be4c579\" id=\"u8be4c579\">]文档以获取已支持的任务和可用参数的完整列表。 </span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"NbUgx\" id=\"NbUgx\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub5752d77\" id=\"ub5752d77\">Pipeline使用</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u6185a52c\" id=\"u6185a52c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0585bec4\" id=\"u0585bec4\">虽然每个任务都有一个关联的[</span><code data-lake-id=\"u12e73064\" id=\"u12e73064\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8fa5cc64\" id=\"u8fa5cc64\">pipeline</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub16ed906\" id=\"ub16ed906\">]，但使用通用的抽象的[</span><code data-lake-id=\"uc44edb88\" id=\"uc44edb88\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3f238f44\" id=\"u3f238f44\">pipeline</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub57a56db\" id=\"ub57a56db\">]更加简单，其中包含所有特定任务的</span><code data-lake-id=\"u400c06b1\" id=\"u400c06b1\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua58a82cd\" id=\"ua58a82cd\">pipelines</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u2450ab7f\" id=\"u2450ab7f\">。[</span><code data-lake-id=\"u65c14053\" id=\"u65c14053\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5f56496e\" id=\"u5f56496e\">pipeline</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u32564788\" id=\"u32564788\">]会自动加载一个默认模型和一个能够进行任务推理的预处理类。让我们以使用[</span><code data-lake-id=\"ub083ee4d\" id=\"ub083ee4d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6f2d455d\" id=\"u6f2d455d\">pipeline</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u4e1f98d2\" id=\"u4e1f98d2\">]进行自动语音识别（ASR）或语音转文本为例。</span></p><ol list=\"uc145586a\"><li fid=\"ua3c2ce1d\" data-lake-id=\"u58bad68e\" id=\"u58bad68e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u303679a4\" id=\"u303679a4\">首先，创建一个[</span><code data-lake-id=\"uce6b1e57\" id=\"uce6b1e57\"><span data-lake-id=\"u40ec33b0\" id=\"u40ec33b0\">pipeline</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uec96b732\" id=\"uec96b732\">]并指定推理任务：</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%3E%3E%3E%20from%20transformers%20import%20pipeline%5Cn%5Cn%3E%3E%3E%20transcriber%20%3D%20pipeline(task%3D%5C%22automatic-speech-recognition%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RZpap%22%7D\"></card><ol list=\"u40bed763\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"ue8423fd7\" data-lake-id=\"u06b171d3\" id=\"u06b171d3\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue630a523\" id=\"ue630a523\">将您的输入传递给[</span><code data-lake-id=\"u65550cff\" id=\"u65550cff\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6f247a85\" id=\"u6f247a85\">pipeline</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u9cbbb4d3\" id=\"u9cbbb4d3\">]。对于语音识别，这通常是一个音频输入文件：</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u40849dee\" id=\"u40849dee\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%3E%3E%3E%20transcriber(%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fhuggingface.co%2Fdatasets%2FNarsil%2Fasr_dummy%2Fresolve%2Fmain%2Fmlk.flac%5C%22)%5Cn%7B'text'%3A%20'I%20HAVE%20A%20DREAM%20BUT%20ONE%20DAY%20THIS%20NATION%20WILL%20RISE%20UP%20LIVE%20UP%20THE%20TRUE%20MEANING%20OF%20ITS%20TREES'%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QF2pn%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uca9d598d\" id=\"uca9d598d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua71efaf5\" id=\"ua71efaf5\">您没有得到您期望的结果？可以在Hub上查看一些</span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/models?pipeline_tag=automatic-speech-recognition&amp;sort=trending\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u37c15dce\" id=\"u37c15dce\"><span data-lake-id=\"ube7cd5d1\" id=\"ube7cd5d1\">最受欢迎的自动语音识别模型</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"uda369a58\" id=\"uda369a58\"> <br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u4917ac59\" id=\"u4917ac59\">，看看是否可以获得更好的转录。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub9f6f511\" id=\"ub9f6f511\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4225ade9\" id=\"u4225ade9\">让我们尝试来自 OpenAI 的</span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/openai/whisper-large\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ubc6e3eb6\" id=\"ubc6e3eb6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2b096a1a\" id=\"u2b096a1a\">Whisper large-v2</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u1d3a5a13\" id=\"u1d3a5a13\"> 模型。Whisperb比Wav2Vec2晚2年发布，使用接近10倍的数据进行了训练。因此，它在大多数下游基准测试上击败了Wav2Vec2。<br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"ufd628053\" id=\"ufd628053\">它还具有预测标点和大小写的附加优势，而Wav2Vec2则无法实现这些功能。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5c546fdc\" id=\"u5c546fdc\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua7e1b880\" id=\"ua7e1b880\">让我们在这里尝试一下，看看它的表现如何：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8e324e00\" id=\"u8e324e00\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%3E%3E%3E%20transcriber%20%3D%20pipeline(model%3D%5C%22openai%2Fwhisper-large-v2%5C%22)%5Cn%3E%3E%3E%20transcriber(%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fhuggingface.co%2Fdatasets%2FNarsil%2Fasr_dummy%2Fresolve%2Fmain%2Fmlk.flac%5C%22)%5Cn%7B'text'%3A%20'%20I%20have%20a%20dream%20that%20one%20day%20this%20nation%20will%20rise%20up%20and%20live%20out%20the%20true%20meaning%20of%20its%20creed.'%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cxn6B%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u285b6239\" id=\"u285b6239\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufb1f40a1\" id=\"ufb1f40a1\">现在这个结果看起来更准确了！要进行深入的Wav2Vec2与Whisper比较，请参阅</span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/learn/audio-course/chapter5/asr_models\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u9df23d6b\" id=\"u9df23d6b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9fd2448f\" id=\"u9fd2448f\">音频变换器课程</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ue25de817\" id=\"ue25de817\">。<br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"ufc94dd8e\" id=\"ufc94dd8e\">我们鼓励您在 Hub 上查看不同语言的模型，以及专业领域的模型等。您可以在Hub上直接查看并比较模型的结果，以确定是否适合或处理边缘情况是否比其他模型更好。如果您没有找到适用于您的用例的模型，您始终可以</span><a href=\"training\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ua1d41def\" id=\"ua1d41def\"><span data-lake-id=\"u426101d7\" id=\"u426101d7\">训练</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u553b56f8\" id=\"u553b56f8\">自己的模型！</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub8d28c13\" id=\"ub8d28c13\"><span data-lake-id=\"u617db52f\" id=\"u617db52f\">如果您有多个输入，您可以将输入作为列表传递：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u15a90e8c\" id=\"u15a90e8c\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22transcriber(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fhuggingface.co%2Fdatasets%2FNarsil%2Fasr_dummy%2Fresolve%2Fmain%2Fmlk.flac%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fhuggingface.co%2Fdatasets%2FNarsil%2Fasr_dummy%2Fresolve%2Fmain%2F1.flac%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5D%5Cn)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zfvlD%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u547090e6\" id=\"u547090e6\"><code data-lake-id=\"u6828838f\" id=\"u6828838f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2a800016\" id=\"u2a800016\">Pipelines</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ufe851f06\" id=\"ufe851f06\">非常适合用于测试，因为从一个模型切换到另一个模型非常琐碎；但是，还有一些方法可以将它们优化后用于大型工作负载而不仅仅是测试。请查看以下指南，深入探讨如何迭代整个数据集或在Web服务器中使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"ub621f4b9\" id=\"ub621f4b9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u19b4a2a7\" id=\"u19b4a2a7\">Pipelines</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uc2cf6795\" id=\"uc2cf6795\">：</span></p><ul list=\"uf5cb9d37\"><li fid=\"ua0bd53e1\" data-lake-id=\"u2da7d221\" id=\"u2da7d221\"><a href=\"#using-pipelines-on-a-dataset\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ue843a01d\" id=\"ue843a01d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4c0b4d70\" id=\"u4c0b4d70\">在数据集上使用流水线</span></a></li><li fid=\"ua0bd53e1\" data-lake-id=\"ue6ef8402\" id=\"ue6ef8402\"><a href=\"./pipeline_webserver\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u31f4be8e\" id=\"u31f4be8e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5bcb5125\" id=\"u5bcb5125\">在Web服务器中使用流水线</span></a></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u63e78b73\" id=\"u63e78b73\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"c6vWH\" id=\"c6vWH\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf7d4d6ee\" id=\"uf7d4d6ee\">参数</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u18f9dd43\" id=\"u18f9dd43\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4ec75b01\" id=\"u4ec75b01\">[</span><code data-lake-id=\"u36c5bdca\" id=\"u36c5bdca\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubc2df2a8\" id=\"ubc2df2a8\">pipeline</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u8dc40272\" id=\"u8dc40272\">] 支持许多参数；有些是适用于特定任务的，而有些适用于所有</span><code data-lake-id=\"u97c0ed7a\" id=\"u97c0ed7a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8032ffe6\" id=\"u8032ffe6\">pipeline</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u8f3a9127\" id=\"u8f3a9127\">。通常情况下，您可以在任何地方指定对应参数：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue8c69949\" id=\"ue8c69949\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22transcriber%20%3D%20pipeline(model%3D%5C%22openai%2Fwhisper-large-v2%5C%22%2C%20my_parameter%3D1)%5Cn%5Cnout%20%3D%20transcriber(...)%20%20%23%20This%20will%20use%20%60my_parameter%3D1%60.%5Cnout%20%3D%20transcriber(...%2C%20my_parameter%3D2)%20%20%23%20This%20will%20override%20and%20use%20%60my_parameter%3D2%60.%5Cnout%20%3D%20transcriber(...)%20%20%23%20This%20will%20go%20back%20to%20using%20%60my_parameter%3D1%60.%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__height%22%3A113.00692749023438%2C%22id%22%3A%22qYpwW%22%2C%22height%22%3A113.00692749023438%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uef1db8e6\" id=\"uef1db8e6\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucc1cd2e4\" id=\"ucc1cd2e4\">让我们查看其中的三个重要参数：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc893948a\" id=\"uc893948a\"><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"fuePg\" id=\"fuePg\"><span data-lake-id=\"udd5710df\" id=\"udd5710df\">设备</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"uf88e9eaf\" id=\"uf88e9eaf\"><span data-lake-id=\"ueffb148f\" id=\"ueffb148f\">如果您使用 </span><code data-lake-id=\"uad671f8e\" id=\"uad671f8e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3e10b0b6\" id=\"u3e10b0b6\">device=n</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u3430a547\" id=\"u3430a547\">，</span><code data-lake-id=\"ud2e8c995\" id=\"ud2e8c995\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8d9fb407\" id=\"u8d9fb407\">pipeline</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u8a3e93f9\" id=\"u8a3e93f9\">会自动将模型放在指定的设备上。无论您使用PyTorch还是Tensorflow，这都可以工作。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u53009356\" id=\"u53009356\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22transcriber%20%3D%20pipeline(model%3D%5C%22openai%2Fwhisper-large-v2%5C%22%2C%20device%3D0)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fKAoa%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u84c375d1\" id=\"u84c375d1\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue27e57f7\" id=\"ue27e57f7\">如果模型对于单个GPU来说过于庞大，并且您正在使用PyTorch，您可以设置 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u17c2abfd\" id=\"u17c2abfd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u07378099\" id=\"u07378099\">device_map=&quot;auto&quot;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uffc1c66d\" id=\"uffc1c66d\"> 以自动确定如何加载和存储模型权重。使用 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u51eda71b\" id=\"u51eda71b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4bbe1843\" id=\"u4bbe1843\">device_map</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uc1af4ea0\" id=\"uc1af4ea0\"> 参数需要安装</span><span data-lake-id=\"u9493f884\" id=\"u9493f884\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"ub2c8b637\" id=\"ub2c8b637\"> </span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/docs/accelerate\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"uc41f8df8\" id=\"uc41f8df8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u414b405a\" id=\"u414b405a\">Accelerate</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u339d8d8c\" id=\"u339d8d8c\"> 软件包：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2d4aa6fe\" id=\"u2d4aa6fe\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22pip%20install%20--upgrade%20accelerate%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RBZVl%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u1f2e892b\" id=\"u1f2e892b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6f48aa36\" id=\"u6f48aa36\">以下代码会自动在各个设备上加载和存储模型权重：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf38647d1\" id=\"uf38647d1\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22transcriber%20%3D%20pipeline(model%3D%5C%22openai%2Fwhisper-large-v2%5C%22%2C%20device_map%3D%5C%22auto%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Rmp5w%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uf4bbf467\" id=\"uf4bbf467\"><span data-lake-id=\"u75c9ab92\" id=\"u75c9ab92\">请注意，如果传递了 </span><code data-lake-id=\"uf0ab23ae\" id=\"uf0ab23ae\"><span data-lake-id=\"u70187a5b\" id=\"u70187a5b\">device_map=&quot;auto&quot;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u8bf5f384\" id=\"u8bf5f384\">，在实例化您的 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u18412ffb\" id=\"u18412ffb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u71286ae2\" id=\"u71286ae2\">pipeline</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u3869ea7c\" id=\"u3869ea7c\"> 时不需要添加 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u01728d40\" id=\"u01728d40\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1bc18c07\" id=\"u1bc18c07\">device=device</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u63ef5be0\" id=\"u63ef5be0\"> 参数，否则可能会遇到一些意外的状况！</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"N2v20\" id=\"N2v20\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1d077f6f\" id=\"u1d077f6f\">批量大小</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"uee115b90\" id=\"uee115b90\"><span data-lake-id=\"u25353cab\" id=\"u25353cab\">默认情况下，</span><code data-lake-id=\"u04792251\" id=\"u04792251\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4dd30825\" id=\"u4dd30825\">pipelines</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ud1691116\" id=\"ud1691116\">不会进行批量推理，原因在</span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/docs/transformers/main_classes/pipelines#pipeline-batching\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u479abfa5\" id=\"u479abfa5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3c081588\" id=\"u3c081588\">这里</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u108abb4c\" id=\"u108abb4c\">详细解释。因为批处理不一定更快，实际上在某些情况下可能会更慢。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf46f625c\" id=\"uf46f625c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufe203f1c\" id=\"ufe203f1c\">但如果在您的用例中起作用，您可以使用：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6a7d4bc4\" id=\"u6a7d4bc4\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22transcriber%20%3D%20pipeline(model%3D%5C%22openai%2Fwhisper-large-v2%5C%22%2C%20device%3D0%2C%20batch_size%3D2)%5Cnaudio_filenames%20%3D%20%5Bf%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fhuggingface.co%2Fdatasets%2FNarsil%2Fasr_dummy%2Fresolve%2Fmain%2F%7Bi%7D.flac%5C%22%20for%20i%20in%20range(1%2C%205)%5D%5Cntexts%20%3D%20transcriber(audio_filenames)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yhqW1%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uf6f25cd2\" id=\"uf6f25cd2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u28dadbaa\" id=\"u28dadbaa\">以上代码会在提供的4个音频文件上运行</span><code data-lake-id=\"u2887c8fc\" id=\"u2887c8fc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9774a787\" id=\"u9774a787\">pipeline</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u90a6cc35\" id=\"u90a6cc35\">，它会将它们以2个一组的批次传递给模型（模型在GPU上，此时批处理更有可能有所帮助），而您无需编写额外的代码。输出应始终与没有批处理时收到的结果相一致。它只是一种帮助您更快地使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"ub5807d98\" id=\"ub5807d98\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub73fbdad\" id=\"ub73fbdad\">pipeline</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub11dab34\" id=\"ub11dab34\">的方式。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub6253ab2\" id=\"ub6253ab2\"><code data-lake-id=\"uba3906ed\" id=\"uba3906ed\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6a741983\" id=\"u6a741983\">pipeline</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u7c2dbdd9\" id=\"u7c2dbdd9\">也可以减轻一些批处理的复杂性，因为对于某些</span><code data-lake-id=\"u971f7354\" id=\"u971f7354\"><span data-lake-id=\"u02e7c071\" id=\"u02e7c071\">pipeline</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u78e0d499\" id=\"u78e0d499\">，需要将单个项目（如长音频文件）分成多个部分以供模型处理。</span><code data-lake-id=\"u75a17cd3\" id=\"u75a17cd3\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucc04da2c\" id=\"ucc04da2c\">pipeline</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue8c46e38\" id=\"ue8c46e38\">为您执行这种</span><a href=\"./main_classes/pipelines#pipeline-chunk-batching\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"uefda7bf8\" id=\"uefda7bf8\"><em><span data-lake-id=\"ubd05ebf0\" id=\"ubd05ebf0\">chunk batching</span></em></a><span data-lake-id=\"ub821ddfb\" id=\"ub821ddfb\">。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"Olu7T\" id=\"Olu7T\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufed7e61b\" id=\"ufed7e61b\">任务特定参数</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"uc8a2161a\" id=\"uc8a2161a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0d950cef\" id=\"u0d950cef\">所有任务都提供了特定于任务的参数，这些参数提供额外的灵活性和选择，以帮助您完成工作。<br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u3766d2e7\" id=\"u3766d2e7\">例如，[</span><code data-lake-id=\"u45544449\" id=\"u45544449\"><span data-lake-id=\"u60c140e8\" id=\"u60c140e8\">transformers.AutomaticSpeechRecognitionPipeline.__call__</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u1e81d97d\" id=\"u1e81d97d\">] 方法具有一个 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u748d24a8\" id=\"u748d24a8\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua390954f\" id=\"ua390954f\">return_timestamps</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u8383a6f1\" id=\"u8383a6f1\"> 参数，对于字幕视频似乎很有帮助：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%3E%3E%3E%20transcriber%20%3D%20pipeline(model%3D%5C%22openai%2Fwhisper-large-v2%5C%22%2C%20return_timestamps%3DTrue)%5Cn%3E%3E%3E%20transcriber(%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fhuggingface.co%2Fdatasets%2FNarsil%2Fasr_dummy%2Fresolve%2Fmain%2Fmlk.flac%5C%22)%5Cn%7B'text'%3A%20'%20I%20have%20a%20dream%20that%20one%20day%20this%20nation%20will%20rise%20up%20and%20live%20out%20the%20true%20meaning%20of%20its%20creed.'%2C%20'chunks'%3A%20%5B%7B'timestamp'%3A%20(0.0%2C%2011.88)%2C%20'text'%3A%20'%20I%20have%20a%20dream%20that%20one%20day%20this%20nation%20will%20rise%20up%20and%20live%20out%20the%20true%20meaning%20of%20its'%7D%2C%20%7B'timestamp'%3A%20(11.88%2C%2012.38)%2C%20'text'%3A%20'%20creed.'%7D%5D%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RbjhH%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u2f6f2645\" id=\"u2f6f2645\"><span data-lake-id=\"u78264e1e\" id=\"u78264e1e\">正如您所看到的，模型推断出了文本，还输出了各个句子发音的</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u78365697\" id=\"u78365697\">时间</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2b14952e\" id=\"u2b14952e\">。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u635637c5\" id=\"u635637c5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u81b3d069\" id=\"u81b3d069\">每个任务都有许多可用的参数，因此请查看每个任务的API参考，以了解您可以进行哪些调整！例如，[</span><code data-lake-id=\"u39dad545\" id=\"u39dad545\"><span data-lake-id=\"udbddb7ac\" id=\"udbddb7ac\">~transformers.AutomaticSpeechRecognitionPipeline</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u5a72d3dc\" id=\"u5a72d3dc\">] 具有 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u7af43a06\" id=\"u7af43a06\"><span data-lake-id=\"u02592360\" id=\"u02592360\">chunk_length_s</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u5be7d47f\" id=\"u5be7d47f\"> 参数，对于处理非常长的音频文件（例如，为整部电影或长达一小时的视频配字幕）非常有帮助，这通常是模型无法单独处理的：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%3E%3E%3E%20transcriber%20%3D%20pipeline(model%3D%5C%22openai%2Fwhisper-large-v2%5C%22%2C%20chunk_length_s%3D30%2C%20return_timestamps%3DTrue)%5Cn%3E%3E%3E%20transcriber(%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fhuggingface.co%2Fdatasets%2Fsanchit-gandhi%2Flibrispeech_long%2Fresolve%2Fmain%2Faudio.wav%5C%22)%5Cn%7B'text'%3A%20%5C%22%20Chapter%2016.%20I%20might%20have%20told%20you%20of%20the%20beginning%20of%20this%20liaison%20in%20a%20few%20lines%2C%20but%20I%20wanted%20you%20to%20see%20every%20step%20by%20which%20we%20came.%20%20I%2C%20too%2C%20agree%20to%20whatever%20Marguerite%20wished%2C%20Marguerite%20to%20be%20unable%20to%20live%20apart%20from%20me.%20It%20was%20the%20day%20after%20the%20evening...%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tyKCQ%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u92482715\" id=\"u92482715\"><span data-lake-id=\"u80edd3f0\" id=\"u80edd3f0\">如果您找不到一个真正有帮助的参数，欢迎</span><a href=\"https://github.com/huggingface/transformers/issues/new?assignees=&amp;labels=feature&amp;template=feature-request.yml\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ue116902a\" id=\"ue116902a\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub384569e\" id=\"ub384569e\">提出请求</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u16563cc9\" id=\"u16563cc9\">！</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"ABrWx\" id=\"ABrWx\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua0fb85df\" id=\"ua0fb85df\">在数据集上使用pipelines</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u693a33cc\" id=\"u693a33cc\"><code data-lake-id=\"u389c8610\" id=\"u389c8610\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8c6c22ad\" id=\"u8c6c22ad\">pipelines</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u6c19f3d5\" id=\"u6c19f3d5\">也可以对大型数据集进行推理。我们建议使用迭代器来完成这一任务，这是最简单的方法：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u048a74e8\" id=\"u048a74e8\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22def%20data()%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20for%20i%20in%20range(1000)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20yield%20f%5C%22My%20example%20%7Bi%7D%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cnpipe%20%3D%20pipeline(model%3D%5C%22openai-community%2Fgpt2%5C%22%2C%20device%3D0)%5Cngenerated_characters%20%3D%200%5Cnfor%20out%20in%20pipe(data())%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20generated_characters%20%2B%3D%20len(out%5B0%5D%5B%5C%22generated_text%5C%22%5D)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22izo7A%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ud7b828b1\" id=\"ud7b828b1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u63318158\" id=\"u63318158\">迭代器 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u19ebf9ea\" id=\"u19ebf9ea\"><span data-lake-id=\"u990f31d9\" id=\"u990f31d9\">data()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u19cda1de\" id=\"u19cda1de\"> 会产生每个结果，</span><code data-lake-id=\"u787c2c68\" id=\"u787c2c68\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue39fc50e\" id=\"ue39fc50e\">pipelines</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u1d5add23\" id=\"u1d5add23\">会自动识别输入为可迭代对象，并在GPU上处理数据的同时开始获取数据（在底层使用</span><a href=\"https://pytorch.org/docs/stable/data.html#torch.utils.data.DataLoader\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ubed06bd8\" id=\"ubed06bd8\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue0c62c21\" id=\"ue0c62c21\">DataLoader</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"uc51f0f51\" id=\"uc51f0f51\">）。这一点非常重要，因为您不必为整个数据集分配内存，可以尽可能快地将数据传送到GPU。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6ec92422\" id=\"u6ec92422\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue0534053\" id=\"ue0534053\">由于批处理可以加速处理，因此在这里尝试调整 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u9ce92b5a\" id=\"u9ce92b5a\"><span data-lake-id=\"uec1b6620\" id=\"uec1b6620\">batch_size</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u094f2d9f\" id=\"u094f2d9f\"> 参数可能会很有用。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub227f425\" id=\"ub227f425\"><span data-lake-id=\"u298aba6c\" id=\"u298aba6c\">迭代数据集的最简单方法就是从</span><span data-lake-id=\"u66022fea\" id=\"u66022fea\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"u8ed3bf00\" id=\"u8ed3bf00\"> </span><a href=\"https://github.com/huggingface/datasets/\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ua7f6c16c\" id=\"ua7f6c16c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u60a9a51e\" id=\"u60a9a51e\">Datasets</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u5d83d8e0\" id=\"u5d83d8e0\"> 中加载数据集：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uddb81f0a\" id=\"uddb81f0a\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20KeyDataset%20is%20a%20util%20that%20will%20just%20output%20the%20item%20we're%20interested%20in.%5Cnfrom%20transformers.pipelines.pt_utils%20import%20KeyDataset%5Cnfrom%20datasets%20import%20load_dataset%5Cn%5Cnpipe%20%3D%20pipeline(model%3D%5C%22hf-internal-testing%2Ftiny-random-wav2vec2%5C%22%2C%20device%3D0)%5Cndataset%20%3D%20load_dataset(%5C%22hf-internal-testing%2Flibrispeech_asr_dummy%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22clean%5C%22%2C%20split%3D%5C%22validation%5B%3A10%5D%5C%22)%5Cn%5Cnfor%20out%20in%20pipe(KeyDataset(dataset%2C%20%5C%22audio%5C%22))%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(out)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22km5Lx%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ua2b36720\" id=\"ua2b36720\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"nLp1Q\" id=\"nLp1Q\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue8ae4c36\" id=\"ue8ae4c36\">在Web服务器上使用pipelines</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u67848efc\" id=\"u67848efc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u804bf838\" id=\"u804bf838\"> 创建推理引擎是一个复杂的主题，值得有自己的页面。 </span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u99450771\" id=\"u99450771\"><a href=\"./pipeline_webserver\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u347c2406\" id=\"u347c2406\"><span data-lake-id=\"uec327405\" id=\"uec327405\">链接</span></a></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"rNcxE\" id=\"rNcxE\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7de9b06e\" id=\"u7de9b06e\">视觉流水线</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u34fd55d4\" id=\"u34fd55d4\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc67ca9a8\" id=\"uc67ca9a8\">对于视觉任务，使用[</span><code data-lake-id=\"u2236667a\" id=\"u2236667a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u14848f98\" id=\"u14848f98\">pipeline</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0c410f58\" id=\"u0c410f58\">] 几乎是相同的。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u358c7174\" id=\"u358c7174\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufceda7dc\" id=\"ufceda7dc\">指定您的任务并将图像传递给分类器。图像可以是链接、本地路径或base64编码的图像。例如，下面显示的是哪种品种的猫？</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u98a8ee8a\" id=\"u98a8ee8a\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fhuggingface.co%2Fdatasets%2Fhuggingface%2Fdocumentation-images%2Fresolve%2Fmain%2Fpipeline-cat-chonk.jpeg%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A960%2C%22originHeight%22%3A686%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22error%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22errorMessage%22%3A%22unknown%20error%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3Anull%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22GtZWO%22%7D\"></card></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%3E%3E%3E%20from%20transformers%20import%20pipeline%5Cn%5Cn%3E%3E%3E%20vision_classifier%20%3D%20pipeline(model%3D%5C%22google%2Fvit-base-patch16-224%5C%22)%5Cn%3E%3E%3E%20preds%20%3D%20vision_classifier(%5Cn...%20%20%20%20%20images%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fhuggingface.co%2Fdatasets%2Fhuggingface%2Fdocumentation-images%2Fresolve%2Fmain%2Fpipeline-cat-chonk.jpeg%5C%22%5Cn...%20)%5Cn%3E%3E%3E%20preds%20%3D%20%5B%7B%5C%22score%5C%22%3A%20round(pred%5B%5C%22score%5C%22%5D%2C%204)%2C%20%5C%22label%5C%22%3A%20pred%5B%5C%22label%5C%22%5D%7D%20for%20pred%20in%20preds%5D%5Cn%3E%3E%3E%20preds%5Cn%5B%7B'score'%3A%200.4335%2C%20'label'%3A%20'lynx%2C%20catamount'%7D%2C%20%7B'score'%3A%200.0348%2C%20'label'%3A%20'cougar%2C%20puma%2C%20catamount%2C%20mountain%20lion%2C%20painter%2C%20panther%2C%20Felis%20concolor'%7D%2C%20%7B'score'%3A%200.0324%2C%20'label'%3A%20'snow%20leopard%2C%20ounce%2C%20Panthera%20uncia'%7D%2C%20%7B'score'%3A%200.0239%2C%20'label'%3A%20'Egyptian%20cat'%7D%2C%20%7B'score'%3A%200.0229%2C%20'label'%3A%20'tiger%20cat'%7D%5D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gZutd%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"Sa3a4\" id=\"Sa3a4\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc40eceb4\" id=\"uc40eceb4\">文本流水线</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uec119eef\" id=\"uec119eef\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf15c983a\" id=\"uf15c983a\">对于NLP任务，使用[</span><code data-lake-id=\"u199e03dc\" id=\"u199e03dc\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc1692d3b\" id=\"uc1692d3b\">pipeline</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u189cbb24\" id=\"u189cbb24\">] 几乎是相同的。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u28dbee10\" id=\"u28dbee10\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%3E%3E%3E%20from%20transformers%20import%20pipeline%5Cn%5Cn%3E%3E%3E%20%23%20This%20model%20is%20a%20%60zero-shot-classification%60%20model.%5Cn%3E%3E%3E%20%23%20It%20will%20classify%20text%2C%20except%20you%20are%20free%20to%20choose%20any%20label%20you%20might%20imagine%5Cn%3E%3E%3E%20classifier%20%3D%20pipeline(model%3D%5C%22facebook%2Fbart-large-mnli%5C%22)%5Cn%3E%3E%3E%20classifier(%5Cn...%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22I%20have%20a%20problem%20with%20my%20iphone%20that%20needs%20to%20be%20resolved%20asap!!%5C%22%2C%5Cn...%20%20%20%20%20candidate_labels%3D%5B%5C%22urgent%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22not%20urgent%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22phone%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22tablet%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22computer%5C%22%5D%2C%5Cn...%20)%5Cn%7B'sequence'%3A%20'I%20have%20a%20problem%20with%20my%20iphone%20that%20needs%20to%20be%20resolved%20asap!!'%2C%20'labels'%3A%20%5B'urgent'%2C%20'phone'%2C%20'computer'%2C%20'not%20urgent'%2C%20'tablet'%5D%2C%20'scores'%3A%20%5B0.504%2C%200.479%2C%200.013%2C%200.003%2C%200.002%5D%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bWqnY%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"sVYYj\" id=\"sVYYj\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9ef86497\" id=\"u9ef86497\">多模态流水线</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u173eb284\" id=\"u173eb284\"><span data-lake-id=\"u489776ff\" id=\"u489776ff\">[</span><code data-lake-id=\"u81b96d27\" id=\"u81b96d27\"><span data-lake-id=\"u33e16c5c\" id=\"u33e16c5c\">pipeline</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ud7f9e7b8\" id=\"ud7f9e7b8\">] 支持多个模态。例如，视觉问题回答（VQA）任务结合了文本和图像。请随意使用您喜欢的任何图像链接和您想要问关于该图像的问题。图像可以是URL或图像的本地路径。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u869c8405\" id=\"u869c8405\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubd42ae81\" id=\"ubd42ae81\">例如，如果您使用这个</span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/spaces/impira/docquery/resolve/2359223c1837a7587402bda0f2643382a6eefeab/invoice.png\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u7e182235\" id=\"u7e182235\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud19b7a40\" id=\"ud19b7a40\">invoice image</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"uf93032c4\" id=\"uf93032c4\">：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf43063b9\" id=\"uf43063b9\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%3E%3E%3E%20from%20transformers%20import%20pipeline%5Cn%5Cn%3E%3E%3E%20vqa%20%3D%20pipeline(model%3D%5C%22impira%2Flayoutlm-document-qa%5C%22)%5Cn%3E%3E%3E%20output%20%3D%20vqa(%5Cn...%20%20%20%20%20image%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fhuggingface.co%2Fspaces%2Fimpira%2Fdocquery%2Fresolve%2F2359223c1837a7587402bda0f2643382a6eefeab%2Finvoice.png%5C%22%2C%5Cn...%20%20%20%20%20question%3D%5C%22What%20is%20the%20invoice%20number%3F%5C%22%2C%5Cn...%20)%5Cn%3E%3E%3E%20output%5B0%5D%5B%5C%22score%5C%22%5D%20%3D%20round(output%5B0%5D%5B%5C%22score%5C%22%5D%2C%203)%5Cn%3E%3E%3E%20output%5Cn%5B%7B'score'%3A%200.425%2C%20'answer'%3A%20'us-001'%2C%20'start'%3A%2016%2C%20'end'%3A%2016%7D%5D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mQOVJ%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u425e9c02\" id=\"u425e9c02\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1f6fc314\" id=\"u1f6fc314\"> 要运行上面的示例，除了</span><span data-lake-id=\"u9cc63733\" id=\"u9cc63733\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"u317fff5b\" id=\"u317fff5b\"> Transformers之外，您需要安装</span><a href=\"https://pypi.org/project/pytesseract/\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u56c28396\" id=\"u56c28396\"><span data-lake-id=\"u518d067d\" id=\"u518d067d\">pytesseract</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u1adaaea8\" id=\"u1adaaea8\">。 sudo apt install -y tesseract-ocr pip install pytesseract </span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"Kfr9S\" id=\"Kfr9S\"><span data-lake-id=\"u75c75789\" id=\"u75c75789\">使用accelerate</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u7bdd1b2e\" id=\"u7bdd1b2e\"><span data-lake-id=\"uebbf1264\" id=\"uebbf1264\">您可以轻松地使用</span><span data-lake-id=\"u92c7fe29\" id=\"u92c7fe29\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"ud3f13a80\" id=\"ud3f13a80\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u8a980531\" id=\"u8a980531\"><span data-lake-id=\"u17b271ee\" id=\"u17b271ee\">accelerate</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ucaddd4a8\" id=\"ucaddd4a8\">在大模型上运行 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ud20413d0\" id=\"ud20413d0\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud7186a77\" id=\"ud7186a77\">pipeline</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u866886f1\" id=\"u866886f1\">！首先确保您已经使用 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ube5373c7\" id=\"ube5373c7\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud3da4dd0\" id=\"ud3da4dd0\">pip install accelerate</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uaa435106\" id=\"uaa435106\"> 安装了 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ueba3680e\" id=\"ueba3680e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u21da1620\" id=\"u21da1620\">accelerate</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ucf353457\" id=\"ucf353457\">。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ucfbce225\" id=\"ucfbce225\"><span data-lake-id=\"uecf8d71c\" id=\"uecf8d71c\">首先使用 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ud95875b4\" id=\"ud95875b4\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc9e3e89e\" id=\"uc9e3e89e\">device_map=&quot;auto&quot;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u2c810c36\" id=\"u2c810c36\"> 加载您的模型！我们将在示例中使用 </span><code data-lake-id=\"uc4c1d228\" id=\"uc4c1d228\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua19c7d35\" id=\"ua19c7d35\">facebook/opt-1.3b</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub1ce1dc3\" id=\"ub1ce1dc3\">。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6081f8c7\" id=\"u6081f8c7\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20pip%20install%20accelerate%5Cnimport%20torch%5Cnfrom%20transformers%20import%20pipeline%5Cn%5Cnpipe%20%3D%20pipeline(model%3D%5C%22facebook%2Fopt-1.3b%5C%22%2C%20torch_dtype%3Dtorch.bfloat16%2C%20device_map%3D%5C%22auto%5C%22)%5Cnoutput%20%3D%20pipe(%5C%22This%20is%20a%20cool%20example!%5C%22%2C%20do_sample%3DTrue%2C%20top_p%3D0.95)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aEter%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uf986fe81\" id=\"uf986fe81\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7e815f27\" id=\"u7e815f27\">如果安装 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u02e1a58c\" id=\"u02e1a58c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u053d9f9b\" id=\"u053d9f9b\">bitsandbytes</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u4284c082\" id=\"u4284c082\"> 并添加参数 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u8095de32\" id=\"u8095de32\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0edead11\" id=\"u0edead11\">load_in_8bit=True</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u417a634f\" id=\"u417a634f\">，您还可以传递8位加载的模型。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u057998ce\" id=\"u057998ce\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20pip%20install%20accelerate%20bitsandbytes%5Cnimport%20torch%5Cnfrom%20transformers%20import%20pipeline%5Cn%5Cnpipe%20%3D%20pipeline(model%3D%5C%22facebook%2Fopt-1.3b%5C%22%2C%20device_map%3D%5C%22auto%5C%22%2C%20model_kwargs%3D%7B%5C%22load_in_8bit%5C%22%3A%20True%7D)%5Cnoutput%20%3D%20pipe(%5C%22This%20is%20a%20cool%20example!%5C%22%2C%20do_sample%3DTrue%2C%20top_p%3D0.95)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RNVl7%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u7b871763\" id=\"u7b871763\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3845501a\" id=\"u3845501a\">请注意，您可以将</span><code data-lake-id=\"u6f278302\" id=\"u6f278302\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1efc4bf9\" id=\"u1efc4bf9\">checkpoint </span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uaa2ec2e2\" id=\"uaa2ec2e2\">替换为任何支持大模型加载的Hugging Face模型，比如BLOOM！</span></p>", "format": "lake", "word_count": 2649, "description": "示例代码📎multimodal-task.ppt注：将ppt后缀名改为zip后解压推理pipeline[pipeline] 让使用Hub上的任何模型进行任何语言、计算机视觉、语音以及多模态任务的推理变得非常简单。即使您对特定的模态没有经验，或者不熟悉模型的源码，您仍然可以使用[pipelin...", "updated_at": "2025-04-28T01:38:34.000Z", "created_at": "2025-04-28T01:37:37.000Z", "id": 217435893, "status": 1}